      "text": "订单服务重构",
      "note": "",
      "order": 0,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": [],
      "fontSize": 26,
      "font": "hei"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bugtp3",
      "parent": "root",
      "text": "目标",
      "note": "这一轮只解决下单链路上最痛的两件事",
      "order": 0,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": [],
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "n_4ifvzp",
      "parent": "n_bugtp3",
      "text": "下单接口 P99 压到 200ms 以内",
      "note": "",
      "order": 0,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "n_5dzl0t",
      "parent": "n_bugtp3",
      "text": "把库存扣减从订单事务里拆出去",
      "note": "",
      "order": 1,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "n_6najta",
      "parent": "root",
      "text": "现在的问题",
      "note": "",
      "order": 1,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "n_5db909",
      "parent": "n_6najta",
      "text": "库存和订单在同一个事务，锁冲突多",
      "note": "",
      "order": 0,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "n_kw9txx",
      "parent": "n_6najta",
      "text": "高峰期超时率 3%，集中在秒杀时段",
      "note": "",
      "order": 1,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "n_yk8wlv",
      "parent": "root",
      "text": "方案",
      "note": "",
      "order": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": [],
      "color": "#fecdd3",
      "textColor": "#b91c1c",
      "lineColor": "#0ea5e9",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "font": "kai"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_89ktg7",
      "parent": "n_yk8wlv",
      "text": "下单后异步扣库存",
      "note": "",
      "order": 0,
      "collapsed": false,
      "links": [
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "label": "扣减逻辑",
          "target": "src/order/service.ts#L120-L180"
